---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Cookie 設定｜四維夜市" description="管理四維夜市旅遊資訊網站的統計 Cookie 偏好。">
  <section class="bg-night-950 py-16 text-white sm:py-20"><div class="container-site max-w-4xl"><Breadcrumbs dark items={[{ label: 'Cookie 設定' }]} /><h1 class="serif-tc mt-10 text-4xl font-black sm:text-6xl">Cookie 設定</h1><p class="mt-5 text-white/65">您可以隨時調整本站的網站分析偏好。</p></div></section>
  <section class="section-space bg-rice-50"><div class="container-site max-w-3xl space-y-7 text-slate-700">
    <article class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-7"><h2 class="text-xl font-black text-night-950">必要功能</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-7">網站導覽與基本內容無須接受統計 Cookie 即可使用。瀏覽器可能保留您選擇的偏好。</p></article>
    <article class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-7"><h2 class="text-xl font-black text-night-950">網站分析（選用）</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-7">開啟後，本站使用 Google Analytics 了解頁面使用情況；關閉後不會由本站主動載入新的 Google Analytics 追蹤程式。若先前已允許，相關 Cookie 可能仍存在於瀏覽器，可另外透過瀏覽器設定清除。</p>
      <label class="mt-5 flex items-center gap-3 font-bold"><input id="analytics-consent" type="checkbox" class="size-5 accent-market-600" />允許網站分析 Cookie</label>
      <button type="button" id="save-cookie" class="mt-5 rounded-full bg-market-600 px-6 py-3 font-black text-white">儲存偏好</button>
      <p id="cookie-message" role="status" aria-live="polite" class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600"></p>
    </article>
    <p class="text-sm leading-7">詳細說明請參閱 <a href="/privacy-policy/" class="font-bold text-market-600 underline">隱私政策</a>。更新：2026 年 11 月 18 日。</p>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
<script is:inline>
  const consentToggle = document.getElementById('analytics-consent');
  const consentMessage = document.getElementById('cookie-message');
  consentToggle.checked = localStorage.getItem('siwei-analytics-consent') === 'yes';
  document.getElementById('save-cookie').addEventListener('click', () => {
    localStorage.setItem('siwei-analytics-consent', consentToggle.checked ? 'yes' : 'no');
    consentMessage.textContent = '偏好已儲存。設定將在重新整理頁面後生效。';
  });
</script>
